{"id":120,"name":"Amnesia","slug":"amnesia","synopsis":"This story takes place in a fictional town, in a fictional country, in a fictional world. One morning, a young lady awakens to find that she has lost all her memories prior to that morning. Her life, her relationships, her very name&mdash;all gone. All that's left is a cell phone with numbers and names she doesn't recognize and Orion, a young boy that only she appears to be able to see. With Orion's guidance, she struggles to make sense of herself, a boyfriend she doesn't know and the thousand and one little things that make up a daily life. But with no memories left, the only alternative is to forge new ones, even if that means leaving old loves behind.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2013,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:28","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 00:02:23","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":15085},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":15085},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":7209},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":9358},{"site":"ANN","externalId":14811},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":5213},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":239,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/TZa6HzhOS90fVGtpwkwgbS5zFiAyqrYUpDUwCAVZ.jpg"},{"id":240,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/3NamKyabtOHziTjupkGrboipHWwzmY1PiB9ZR1w5.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":58,"name":"Brain's Base","slug":"brains_base"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":5307,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":5307,"title":"Zoetrope","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":6084,"version":1,"episodes":"1-11","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":4932,"basename":"Amnesia-OP1.webm","filename":"Amnesia-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Amnesia-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":40048052,"resolution":1080,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","tags":"BD1080","audio":{"id":4460,"basena